Mum.", "w": 0.15384614732530388, "h": 0.011536027412552254}, {"x": 0.8406696207904232, "w": 0.10220280117458769, "y": 0.7000007595022272, "h": 0.01248394610649412, "text": "(go) to school."}, {"w": 0.18425759209526904, "x": 0.5778175397603558, "h": 0.012645348314774147, "y": 0.7144622095635432, "text": "Mum: Bye. See you later."}, {"h": 0.014133574007220128, "y": 0.7282716605281895, "text": "3 Val: What's wrong? Where's Tom?", "w": 0.2844364929199219, "x": 0.5509839035176776}, {"text": "Belle:", "y": 0.7433615111905385, "w": 0.04490868462456599, "h": 0.011750814759774342, "x": 0.5759356402464553}, {"h": 0.012645348314774147, "y": 0.7435465118258977, "w": 0.16457960340711808, "x": 0.7620751370561308, "text": "(play) tennis with Steve"}, {"y": 0.7573240073776153, "w": 0.12164579603407122, "text": "and I'm all alone.", "h": 0.011513201768647938, "x": 0.6314847927700843}, {"w": 0.15742396036783857, "y": 0.7726308142147059, "x": 0.5509839072937194, "text": "4 Andy: Hey, Stuart,", "h": 0.012645348314774147}, {"x": 0.8388119950014485, "w": 0.06835096571180554, "h": 0.01368458081668889, "y": 0.7721111981252066, "text": "(use) your"}, {"text": "phone now?", "y": 0.7866734141689089, "x": 0.6293505829369888, "w": 0.08465501573350698, "h": 0.011624424552228872}, {"y": 0.8004505818673221, "w": 0.2719141303168402, "h": 0.012645348314774242, "text": "Stuart: No. Do you want to borrow it?", "x": 0.5706618967974535}, {"x": 0.55094532227237, "w": 0.06268896314832906, "text": "5 Dad:", "h": 0.010357343345772931, "y": 0.8155044676266229}, {"x": 0.7638640439509926, "text": "(write) an email?", "y": 0.8142509025573528, "w": 0.11449016147189672, "h": 0.010225841293266062}, {"y": 0.8307994188452386, "w": 0.04472271813286666, "h": 0.010116278651819317, "x": 0.5706618961884862, "text": "Jack:"}, {"h": 0.013909883895075349, "x": 0.6296958884816435, "y": 0.8282703485762632, "text": "No, I'm looking for a summer job.", "w": 0.2379248555501302}, {"y": 0.8440531571519944, "x": 0.548756419895996, 